Description:
Prevents filling watering can from inappropriate water sources.
<br />
<br />Make watering can be not filled on tiles with the string property "[b]WaterSource[/b]" is "[b]F[/b]".
<br />You can edit the map file(.tmx) to add the corresponding map.
<br />To do this, Add property on tiles in tileset by using [url=https://www.mapeditor.org/]Tiled[/url] or text editor.
<br />
<br />using text editor ex)
<br />  &lt;tile id="7"&gt;
<br />   &lt;properties&gt;
<br />    &lt;property name="Water" value="T"/&gt;
<br />    [u]&lt;property name="WaterSource" value="F"/&gt;[/u]
<br />   &lt;/properties&gt;
<br />  &lt;/tile&gt;
<br />
<br />This mod uses Harmony patch.
<br />Source code is [url=https://github.com/idermailer/iDontUseThatWater]here[/url].
